<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>01 · POSITIONING</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            三道断层，卡住了企业 AI 的最后一公里
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44 }}>
            {/* 左侧断裂链路图 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 600 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 168, height: 128, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 22, background: '#DCE7FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 20, height: 20, borderRadius: 10, background: '#2563EB' }} />
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>理解业务</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>进不了私有数据</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 48, height: 128, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <svg width={44} height={28} viewBox='0 0 44 28'>
                            <path d='M2 12 L20 0 L20 28 Z' fill='#F59E0B' />
                            <path d='M42 12 L24 0 L24 28 Z' fill='#F59E0B' opacity='0.55' />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 168, height: 128, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 22, background: '#DCE7FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 20, height: 20, borderRadius: 4, background: '#0891B2' }} />
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>动手执行</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>够不着工具系统</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 48, height: 128, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <svg width={44} height={28} viewBox='0 0 44 28'>
                            <path d='M2 12 L20 0 L20 28 Z' fill='#F59E0B' />
                            <path d='M42 12 L24 0 L24 28 Z' fill='#F59E0B' opacity='0.55' />
                        </svg>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 168, height: 128, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 22, background: '#DCE7FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 20, height: 20, borderRadius: 10, background: '#F59E0B' }} />
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>沉淀复用</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>过不了合规审批</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 18 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    通用 AI 的能力链：三处断点让它停在演示阶段
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    模型能力已经足够，缺的是把它接进企业现场的三段路：让它读得到私有数据、准予它调用工具，并且有人管得住它。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            {/* 右侧三断层解读 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 516 }}>
                <Box style={{ paddingBottom: 14, borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                        01　数据断层
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        业务知识散落在文档、即时消息、业务系统与人脑里，通用模型没有检索入口，只能给出放之四海而皆准的答案。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                        02　工具断层
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        没有文件、命令、浏览器与业务系统的执行权限，AI 的结论永远停在「建议你这样做」，价值进不了业务流程。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ paddingTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                        03　管控断层
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        缺少审批、命令守卫与调用留痕，安全团队无法回答「它刚才到底做了什么」，于是越能干越不敢放手。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 结论条 */}
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                试点停在演示阶段的主因不是模型不够强，而是数据、工具、管控这三项工程基础设施缺位——这三项补齐，AI 才进得了生产。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
